# CODEOWNERS — {{PROJECT_NAME}}
#
# Required reviewer teams for AI-Workflows control-plane surfaces. The
# placeholder teams (@{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform / -pm / -security) MUST be
# replaced with real GitHub team handles BEFORE merge protection is
# turned on — see docs/setup/separation-of-duties.md for the wiring.
#
# Syntax: github.com/<org>/<team>  (e.g. @acme/platform).
# First match wins; later, more-specific patterns override earlier ones.

# Default — fall-through owner for everything not matched below.
*                                @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform

# Control-plane: hooks, agents, rules, settings.
# Any change to these can shift agent behaviour across every task —
# requires platform review.
/.claude/                        @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform
/.claude/**                      @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform
/.claude/hooks/**                @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform
/.claude/settings.json           @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform

# Rules — auto-loaded on every session, including A### / L### rules.
# Requires BOTH platform + security review (defense-in-depth).
/.claude/rules/*.md              @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-security

# Playbooks — the deep operational documents agents follow.
/docs/playbooks/                 @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform
/docs/playbooks/**               @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform

# Spec / sprint / backlog — product surface. PMs own scope.
/docs/spec/                      @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-pm
/docs/spec/**                    @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-pm
/docs/spec/audit/                @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-security
/docs/spec/audit/**              @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-security

# Setup docs — the "how does this template work" surface.
/docs/setup/                     @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform
/docs/setup/secret-handling.md   @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-security
/docs/setup/compliance-mapping.md @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-security
/docs/setup/separation-of-duties.md @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-security
/docs/setup/permission-profiles.md  @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-security

# CODEOWNERS itself — meta. Requires platform + security so a single
# team cannot silently relax review requirements.
/.github/CODEOWNERS              @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-platform @{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-security
